creatures:
- name: Young Bronze Dragon
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 142 (rollable(dice=15d10 + 60,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Fly 80 ft., Swim 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=21)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Insight rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Insight Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** lightning  
      **Senses** blindsight 30 ft., darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 17  
      **Languages** Common, Draconic  
      **Challenge** 8 (3,900 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Traits

      ***Amphibious.*** The dragon can breathe air and water.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Repulsion Breath.

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10+5,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage.

      ***Lightning Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Lightning Breath])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 15, each creature in a 60-foot-long, 5-foot-wide ***Line***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=9d10,dicelabel=Damage [Lightning Breath]) Lightning damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ***Repulsion Breath.*** *Strength Saving Throw:* DC 15, each creature in a 30-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* The target is pushed up to 40 feet straight away from the dragon and has the ***Prone*** condition.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Dragon (Metallic), Lawful Good*  
    **Challenge** 8
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024youngbronzedragon
  status: 1

